    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-8b408880611a47bde7a47c8c",
      "path_or_url": "observatory.md",
      "section": "Observatory archive",
      "snippet": "# Observatory archive\n\nThese instructions govern the observatory's physical photographic plates, including plates borrowed from partner observatories.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "af2346e74420595ce29c3cefdba2997e8541be5a25edea4a139cf1e69617a156",
      "project_identity": "local:aab9dc703acc3da501b58414194c3a6874093ab30032bc097c0490c78f5a637d",
      "line_start": 1,
      "line_end": 4,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/30ece3627184abafa0827ba9"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-5cfbb17e1f76ab196267cac6",
      "path_or_url": "observatory.md",
      "section": "Observatory archive > Dispatch",
      "snippet": "## Dispatch\n\nDispatch a photographic plate only after its catalogue number has been entered on a padded crate label. The receiving curator must acknowledge the inventory before the crate leaves the archive.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "78566564c187eaa3575211e5868f3b327e2c756c27f3b86aad016dc7d14febde",
      "project_identity": "local:aab9dc703acc3da501b58414194c3a6874093ab30032bc097c0490c78f5a637d",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 8,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/4808bd78fca9916b1b125e10"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-2b7d05b03598c6430fa83985",
      "path_or_url": "observatory.md",
      "section": "Observatory archive > Dispatch > Packing",
      "snippet": "### Packing\n\nPlace each plate in an acid-free sleeve with the emulsion facing away from the seam. Separate sleeved plates with rigid spacers.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "0a54cfa49cb91f65103db7fdee4215fbd0d25cfd375fbc2dc84fd2de891a67e5",
      "project_identity": "local:aab9dc703acc3da501b58414194c3a6874093ab30032bc097c0490c78f5a637d",
      "line_start": 9,
      "line_end": 12,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/7dae14f846f5c1d64749936c"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-5f0a9c0c9d62f62f2cd8d3b4",
      "path_or_url": "observatory.md",
      "section": "Observatory archive > Dispatch > Label printer",
      "snippet": "### Label printer\n\nThe label printer uses violet ribbon. Its paper tray is refilled from the lower stationery drawer; printer ribbon colour does not identify plate ownership.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "1a7ec70ba13ea63c05ad86fe197e502eac119d19efc242673c78c8b546a046d3",
      "project_identity": "local:aab9dc703acc3da501b58414194c3a6874093ab30032bc097c0490c78f5a637d",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 16,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/b0b80ee1bed623fc0c58a8bd"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-bb32e7b34b64f446f705f1f9",
      "path_or_url": "observatory.md",
      "section": "Observatory archive > Partner restriction",
      "snippet": "## Partner restriction\n\nA photographic plate borrowed from a partner observatory must not be dispatched until the lending institution gives written permission, even when the receiving curator has acknowledged the inventory.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "f720f0912dc056cb92724c901eccc7b3e72546e6d4797a9fcb63888065275f55",
      "project_identity": "local:aab9dc703acc3da501b58414194c3a6874093ab30032bc097c0490c78f5a637d",
      "line_start": 17,
      "line_end": 20,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/42897038ce7d354f2af72b4a"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-2ffffd53b7253a2541a7798f",
      "path_or_url": "observatory.md",
      "section": "Observatory archive > Visitor register",
      "snippet": "## Visitor register\n\nArchive visitors sign a paper register retained for fourteen months. The register is kept at the reception desk.\n\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "a02d2d045fed0985f2b1cfbe67c09fd85a1cc405874d29a567168fbfd01cb54b",
      "project_identity": "local:aab9dc703acc3da501b58414194c3a6874093ab30032bc097c0490c78f5a637d",
      "line_start": 21,
      "line_end": 24,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/48d8db8231a332567e53a7ee"
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "ev-b21a146e26fe4e58ad55ee1d",
      "path_or_url": "observatory.md",
      "section": "Observatory archive > Corridor lighting",
      "snippet": "## Corridor lighting\n\nThe archive corridor lights switch off at twenty-one hundred hours. A separate emergency light remains illuminated overnight.\n",
      "version_binding": "unversioned",
      "content_sha256": "6c6742764ee5dc86763c2dac871913b9e914f938892a0daa43e6f1690e0a6df1",
      "project_identity": "local:aab9dc703acc3da501b58414194c3a6874093ab30032bc097c0490c78f5a637d",
      "line_start": 25,
      "line_end": 27,
      "authority": "source_of_truth",
      "scope": "project",
      "source_uri": "docatlas://source/v2/cd99c6ef2d4d31b916a9eab9"
    }
  ],
